{
 "purpose": "Real feature takes of the public Pli APK for the product film. The cast lines are played into the public voice session; the app's own answers are recorded as they happen. Lines with `audio` are played from the generated scene where the child says them (LTX picture + voice); the app's own voice is recorded from its speaker. 2026-11-14: cast lines come from the Figma Weave scenes (Seedance 2.5); every take drives; clock fixed to a weekday 17:30.",
